 "notes": "Merged file = previous run2/esr_anr.json ANR rows (all kept) + this pass. Matching: exact UPPERCASE surname (or 'contains' fragment for compound/accented names, or exact first-name search for very common surnames), then first-name + institution/field check; ORCID used where present. ANR_02 caveat: the Responsable_scientifique columns hold the PROJECT coordinator, repeated on every partner row (e.g. Okomera/Orakl rows show Fanny Jaulin), so a founder hit in ANR_02 means the founder coordinated the whole programme; amounts there are consortium totals. before_company = project year (from code/edition) < company creation year (an/summary.json fy; endogenebio=2022); same-year projects count as after. Ksilink RUBINeuroStress 2019 predates SAS (2021) and is likely the Ksilink association. Orakl Oncology (created 2023) is listed as partner of RHU ORGANOMIC (edition 2021) coordinated by founder Fanny Jaulin - likely added by amendment. Eligo FAREWEL ANR-16-CE18-0021: company was coordinator (EUR 218,196) - missed by previous pass. Totals (ANR_01 per-partner aid): founder-as-academic EUR 8,405,439.71 (before company EUR 5,316,827.74; after EUR 3,088,611.97); company-as-partner EUR 1,353,928.86 (includes 2 Ksilink rows tagged association-like). ANR_02: 11 participations (8 company, 3 founder-coordinator)."
